---
output: svg
---
@startuml x
' Regression test: with "stateDiagramEdgeLabelStyle node", a tagged
' transition's label is drawn as its own intermediate node (see
' CommandLinkStateCommon.createTransitionWithIntermediateNode). That node now
' carries the transition's own tag too, so removing the transition by its
' tag drops the label along with it instead of leaving it floating with a
' dangling arrow to nowhere (the same failure mode fixed for endpoint tags in
' node-style-transition-label-orphaned-by-remove.puml).
skinparam stateDiagramEdgeLabelStyle node

state Idle
state Charging

Idle --> Charging $keep : start / begin()

remove $keep
@enduml
